# Per-machine assistant memory. ~/.claude/projects/<slug>/memory symlinks here,
# so these are personal working notes that happen to live under the repo root.
# Scoped to memory/ rather than all of .claude/, which may later hold shared
# agent or command definitions that are worth committing.
.claude/memory/

